# Vite production build settings.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset for the single-container image (backend serves
# the SPA and the API on the same origin, so the SPA calls /api).
#
# Only for a split deployment (SPA on a separate static host) set it at
# build time to the API origin, e.g. in the host's build env:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://<your-api-host>/api
